return ['domain'=>'page-builder-sandwich','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'uz_UZ','project-id-version'=>'page-builder-sandwich','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-26T16:59:17+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-26T16:59:17+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Page Builder Sandwich','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/page-builder-sandwich'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/page-builder-sandwich','The foundation release of the rebuilt Page Builder Sandwich: a settings and About screen, a footprint-free front-end output layer, and one sample content block.'=>'Qayta qurilgan Page Builder Sandwich-ning asosiy relizi: sozlamalar va "Haqida" ekrani, qidiruv tizimi izlaridan xoli old qism chiquvchi qatlami va bitta namuna tarkib bloki.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','AI providers'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt provayderlari','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'ChatGPT yaratuvchilari. Yaxshi universal yordamchi.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Claude yaratuvchilari. Yozishda kuchli va ehtiyotkorona fikrlashda ustun.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Google ning Gemini modellari. Tez va arzon.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Tez va arzon modellarga ega Yevropa sun\'iy intellekt kompaniyasi.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Matn yozish va dasturlashda yaxshi bo\'lgan arzon modellar.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Ko\'plab turli provayderlardagi modellar uchun bitta kalit.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'OpenAI API kabi ishlaydigan har qanday xizmat, jumladan, o\'z kompyuteringiz yoki serveringizda ishlaydigan model.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Umumiy (aniqroq sozlama ko\'rsatilmaganda qo\'llaniladi)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Yozish va qayta yozish','Translation'=>'Tarjima','Code and CSS'=>'Kod va CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Kechirasiz, bu sahifaga kirishga ruxsat berilmagan.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Bu sozlamalar ulardan foydalanadigan har bir plagin tomonidan umumiy foydalaniladi: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Kalitlaringiz ushbu sayt maʼlumotlar bazasida shifrlangan va faqat siz tanlagan provayderga yuboriladi — hech qachon bizga emas.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'1-qadam: 2 tadan: sun\'iy intellekt provayderini tanlang','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Siz oʻz kalitingizdan foydalanasiz, shuning uchun isteʼmolingiz uchun toʻgʻridan-toʻgʻri provayderga toʻlaysiz. Ishonchingiz komil emasmi? Bularning barchasi yaxshi ishlaydi; keyinroq yana qoʻshishingiz mumkin.','Next'=>'Keyingi','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'2-qadam: %s ni ulang','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'OpenAI-mos keluvchi xizmatingiz manzilini oxirida /v1 bilan kiriting. Kalit faqat xizmat uni talab qilgandagina kerak bo\'ladi.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'%s ni oching va tizimga kiring (yoki bepul hisob yarating).','the %s API keys page'=>'%s API kalitlari sahifasi','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Yangi kalit yarating va uni nusxalang.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Uni quyida qo\'ying va "Saqlash va sinash" tugmasini bosing. Uning ishlashini tekshirish uchun bitta kichik so\'rov yuboramiz.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Aksar provayderlar kalit ishlashi uchun hisobda biroz mablag‘ talab qiladi: %s.','add credit'=>'hisobni to\'ldirish','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Boshqa provayderni tanlash','Address'=>'Manzil','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Saqlangan kalit …%s bilan tugaydi — uning o\'rniga yangisini qo\'ying','Key (optional)'=>'Kalit (ixtiyoriy)','API key'=>'API kaliti','Save and test'=>'Saqlash va sinovdan o\'tkazish','Providers'=>'Provayderlar','Provider'=>'Provayder','Status'=>'Holat','Key'=>'Kalit','Get a key'=>'Kalitni olish','Test'=>'Sinov','Remove'=>'Olib tashlash','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Yangiroq plagin versiyasi tomonidan saqlangan: ushbu plaginni yangilang yoki kalitni qaytadan kiriting.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Saqlangan kalitni endi ochib bo\'lmaydi (saytning xavfsizlik kalitlari o\'zgargan). Uni qayta kiriting.','Not connected'=>'Ulanmagan','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Ulangan — oxirgi sinovdan o\'tdi %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Oxirgi sinov muvaffaqiyatsiz tugadi: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Ulangan — hali sinovdan o‘tkazilmagan','Which model to use'=>'Qaysi modeldan foydalanish kerak','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ bu vazifa uchun tavsiyamizni bildiradi. Roʻyxat kalitingiz foydalanishi mumkin boʻlgan barcha modellarni oʻz ichiga oladi va ular provayderdan jonli oʻqib olinadi.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— Provayder uchun tavsiya etiladi —','Save models'=>'Modellarni saqlash','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Ta\'minotchilardan model ro\'yxatlarini yangilash','best quality'=>'eng yaxshi sifat','lowest cost'=>'eng arzon narx','fastest'=>'eng tez','Add a model yourself'=>'Modelni o\'zingiz qo\'shing','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Bugun yangi model chiqdimi? Uni darhol ishlatish uchun uning aniq nomini kiriting.','Model name'=>'Model nomi','Add model'=>'Model qo\'shish','Recommended models list'=>'Tavsi etilgan modellar ro\'yxati','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Tavsiya etilgan modellar roʻyxatini tekshirib boʻlmadi, shuning uchun hech qanday tavsiya koʻrsatilmagan. Plaginni qayta oʻrnating yoki quyida kundalik yangilanishlarni yoqing.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Foydalanilayotgan roʻyxat %s da eʼlon qilingan. Har bir plagin yangilanishi yangisini olib keladi.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Yangilangan roʻyxat uchun kuniga bir marta Zinn Digital® ni ham tekshirib turing.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Faqat oddiy yuklab olish soʻrovi yuboriladi: kalit ham, sayt manzili ham, kontentingiz haqida hech narsa yuborilmaydi. Roʻyxat imzolanadi va imzo tekshiruvidan oʻta olmagan roʻyxat eʼtiborga olinmaydi.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Oxirgi marta tekshirilgan vaqt %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Saqlang va yoqilgan bo\'lsa, hoziroq tekshiring','a newer list was installed'=>'yangiroq ro\'yxat o\'rnatildi','already up to date'=>'allaqachon yangilangan','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'yuklab olish imzo tekshiruvidan o‘tmadi va e’tiborga olinmadi','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Zinn Digital® bilan bog‘lanib bo‘lmadi; joriy ro‘yxat ishlatilishda davom etadi','turned off'=>'o\'chirilgan','Open'=>'Ochish','Check their status page'=>'Ularning holat sahifasini tekshiring','Open your billing page'=>'Hisob-kitob sahifangizni oching','Open your API keys page'=>'API kalitlari sahifasini oching','Open the AI settings'=>'AI sozlamalarini ochish','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Kechirasiz, buni qilishga ruxsatingiz yo\'q.','Unknown provider.'=>'Noma\'lum provayder.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Xizmatingiz manzilini kiriting, masalan, http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Bu API kalitiga o\'xshamaydi. Uni probelsiz holda qayta nusxalang.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Avval API kalitingizni qo\'ying.','Key removed.'=>'Kalit olib tashlandi.','Models saved.'=>'Modellar saqlandi.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Modelning aniq nomini kiriting, masalan, provayder hujjatlarida yozilganidek.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'%s qo\'shildi. Uni "Qaysi modeldan foydalanish" ostidan tanlang.','Model removed.'=>'Model olib tashlandi.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Kunlik yangilanishlar o‘chirilgan. Plagin bilan birga kelgan ro‘yxat ishlatiladi.','Checked: %s.'=>'Tekshirildi: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'Model roʻyxatlari yangilandi.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Sizning sun\'iy intellekt kalitingiz plaginlaringizdan birining yangiroq versiyasi tomonidan saqlangan. Ushbu plaginni yangilang yoki sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalarida kalitni qaytadan kiriting.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Saqlangan AI kalitingizni ochib bo\'lmaydi (sayt xavfsizlik kalitlari o\'zgargan). Uni AI sozlamalarida qaytadan kiriting.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt hali sozlangan emas. AI sozlamalarida sun\'iy intellekt provayderi uchun kalit qo\'shing.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Bu vazifa uchun hech qanday model tanlanmagan. AI sozlamalaridan birini tanlang.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Bu sun\'iy intellekt provayderi plaginning ushbu versiyasi tomonidan qo\'llab-quvvatlanmaydi.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Bu sayt sizning sun\'iy intellekt xizmatingizga ulanolmadi. U ishlayotganini va uning manziliga veb-serveringizdan ulanish mumkinligini tekshiring (shaxsiy kompyuteringizdagi xizmatga xostdagi saytdan ulanib bo\'lmaydi).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Ushbu sayt %s manziliga ulanolmadi. Ularning holat sahifasini tekshiring; agar u ishlayotgan bo\'lsa, xostingiz chiquvchi ulanishlarni bloklayotgan bo\'lishi mumkin yoki manzil noto\'g\'ri.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s hisobingizda mablagʻ yoki kvota qolmaganini bildiradi. Ularning hisobidan mablagʻ qoʻshing yoki limitni oshiring, soʻngra qaytadan urinib koʻring.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s kalitingizni qabul qilmadi. U xato kiritilgan, bekor qilingan yoki muddati tugagan bo\'lishi mumkin. Yangi kalit yarating va uni shu yerga qo\'ying.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s kalitingiz uchun qilingan ushbu so‘rovni rad etdi. Kalit ushbu model yoki funksiyaga kirish huquqiga ega bo‘lmasligi mumkin yoki hisobingizni tasdiqlash talab etiladi.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Sizning kalitingiz uchun "%1$s" modeli %2$s tomonidan taqdim etilmaydi. Sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalaridan boshqa modelni tanlang.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Sizning %2$s rejangiz "%1$s" modelini o\'z ichiga olmaydi. AI sozlamalarida boshqa modelni tanlang yoki rejangizni ular bilan yangilang.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s kalitingiz soʻrovlarni yuborish tezligini cheklamoqda. Bir daqiqa kutib, qaytadan urinib koʻring yoki ular bilan limitni oshiring.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s bilan hozirda muammolar mavjud (ularning tomonidan uzilish yoki haddan tashqari yuklanish). Sozlamalaringizda hech qanday xatolik yo\'q. Qisqa vaqtdan keyin yana urinib ko\'ring.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt so\'rovi biz aniqlay olmagan sababga ko\'ra bajarilmadi. Qaytadan urinib ko\'ring; agar muammo takrorlanaversa, quyidagi ma\'lumotlar bilan qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga murojaat qiling.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'AI provayderi ushbu plagin o‘qiy olmaydigan shaklda javob berdi. Qaytadan urinib ko‘ring; agar bu holat takrorlanaversa, boshqa modelni tanlang yoki yordam xizmatiga murojaat qiling.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Maxsus (OpenAI-mos keluvchi)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Avval ushbu provayder uchun kalitni saqlang.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Kalitingiz ishlayapti, ammo provayder unda matnli modelni koʻrsatmagan. Quyida oʻzingiz model qoʻshing.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Ulangan. %1$s %2$s yordamida javob berdi. Sun\'iy intellekt funksiyalaringiz foydalanishga tayyor.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Sizning foydalanuvchi rolingizga ushbu saytda sun\'iy intellektdan foydalanishga ruxsat etilmagan. Administratorga murojaat qiling.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Bu sayt oylik sun\'iy intellekt xarajatlari limitiga yetdi. Administrator buni sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalarida oshirishi mumkin.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Bu sayt sun\'iy intellekt so\'rovlarining oylik limitiga yetdi. Administrator buni sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalarida oshirishi mumkin.','Usage and cost'=>'Foydalanish va narx','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Jurnal, cheklovlar va rol ruxsatlari quyidagi orqali ishlatiladigan sun\'iy intellektga nisbatan qo\'llaniladi: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Xarajatlar taxminiy bo\'lib, e\'lon qilingan narxlardan kelib chiqqan holda hisoblangan; narxi noma\'lum bo\'lgan model nolga teng deb olinadi.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Bu oy: %1$s soʻrov, taxminan %2$s.','When'=>'Qachon','Who'=>'Kim','Used for'=>'Quyidagilar uchun ishlatiladi','Model'=>'Model','Tokens in / out'=>'Kiruvchi / chiquvchi tokenlar','About'=>'Haqida','Result'=>'Natija','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Hali hech qanday sun\'iy intellekt so\'rovlari yuborilmagan.','Done'=>'Bajarildi','Limits and permissions'=>'Chegaralar va ruxsatlar','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Oylik xarajat limiti (US dollari)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Cheksiz qoldirish uchun bo\'sh qoldiring. Taxminiy xarajat unga yetganda AI oyning qolgan qismi uchun to\'xtaydi.','Monthly request limit'=>'Oylik soʻrovlar limiti','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Cheklash qo\'ymaslik uchun bo\'sh qoldiring.','Who may use AI'=>'Sun\'iy intellektdan kimlar foydalanishi mumkin','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Plagin funksiyalaridan foydalana oladigan har bir kishi sun\'iy intellektdan foydalanishiga ruxsat berish uchun hech birini beliralamang. Administratorlar undan doimo foydalanishi mumkin.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Cheklovlar va ruxsatlarni saqlash','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'Cheklovlar va ruxsatlar saqlandi.','Security error, please refresh the page and try again.'=>'Xavfsizlik xatosi, sahifani yangilang va qaytadan urinib ko\'ring.','Missing newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Axborotnoma sozlamalari topilmadi. Iltimos, administrator bilan bog\'laning.','Invalid newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Yangiliklar tasmasi sozlamalari noto\'g\'ri. Iltimos, administrator bilan bog\'laning.','Invalid email address.'=>'Yaroqsiz elektron pochta manzili.','Too many attempts. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Urinishlar soni juda ko\'p. Iltimos, bir necha daqiqadan so\'ng yana urinib ko\'ring.','Something went wrong. Please contact the admin.'=>'Nimadir xato ketdi. Iltimos, administrator bilan bog\'laning.','Map'=>'Bog‘lash','Background video'=>'Fon video','%1$s: %2$d font files stored, stylesheet %3$s'=>'%1$s: %2$d ta shrift fayli saqlangan, %3$s uslublar jadvali','That family is not stored.'=>'Bu oila saqlanmagan.','Removed.'=>'O\'chirilgan.','That is not a valid font family name.'=>'Bu yaroqli shrift oilasi nomi emas.','Google Fonts did not return that family. Check the name and try again.'=>'Google Fonts bu shriftlar oilasini qaytarmadi. Nomini tekshiring va qaytadan urinib ko\'ring.','The font files could not be downloaded or saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Shrift fayllarini yuklab oling yoki saqlab bo\'lmadi. Yuklashlar papkasiga yozib bo\'lishini tekshiring.','The font stylesheet could not be saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Shrift uslublar jadvalini saqlab bo‘lmadi. Yuklashlar papkasiga yozish mumkinligini tekshiring.','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'PlaginningUshbu nusxasidagi admin ekranining skriptlari yetishmayapti. Uni chiqarilgan paketdan qaytadan o\'rnating.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Ushbu ekran uchun JavaScript talab qilinadi.','Languages'=>'Tillar','Upgrade'=>'Yangilash','Pricing'=>'Narxlar','Start Trial'=>'Sinov muddatini boshlash','Account'=>'Hisob','Contact Us'=>'Biz bilan bog‘laning','Affiliation'=>'Hamkorlik','the kind of softwarePlugin'=>'Plagin','greetingHey %s,'=>'Salom %s,','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiyalar yangilanishlari, o‘quv qo‘llanmalari va vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar bo‘yicha elektron pochta xabarnomalarini olish hamda asosiy WordPress muhiti ma\'lumotlarini ulashish uchun ro‘yxatdan o‘ting. Bu bizga %s ni saytingizga moslashuvchanroq qilishga va sizga kerakli vazifalarni yanada yaxshiroq bajarishiga yordam beradi.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlari, oʻquv materiallari hamda vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar boʻyicha elektron pochta xabarnomalarini olish hamda asosiy WordPress muhiti haqida baʼzi maʼlumotlarni ulashish uchun roʻyxatdan oʻting.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Buni o\'tkazib yuborsangiz ham muammo yo\'q! %1$s baribir yaxshi ishlayveradi.','Allow & Continue'=>'Ruxsat berish va davom etish','verbSkip'=>'O‘tkazib yuborish','Skipping, please wait'=>'O‘tkazib yuborilmoqda, iltimos kuting','Continue'=>'Davom etish','Please wait'=>'Iltimos, kuting','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Faollashtirilmoqda','This will allow %s to'=>'Bu %s ga quyidagilarga ruxsat beradi','Privacy Policy'=>'Maxfiylik siyosati','Terms of Service'=>'Foydalanish shartlari','License Agreement'=>'Litsenziya shartnomasi','Have a license key?'=>'Litsenziya kalitingiz bormi?','Activate License'=>'Litsenziyani faollashtirish','View Basic Profile Info'=>'Asosiy profil ma\'lumotlarini ko\'rish','Your WordPress user\'s: first & last name, and email address'=>'Sizning WordPress foydalanuvchingiz: ismi va familiyasi hamda elektron pochta manzili','View Basic Website Info'=>'Asosiy veb-sayt ma\'lumotlarini ko\'rish','Homepage URL & title, WP & PHP versions, and site language'=>'Bosh sahifa URL manzili va sarlavhasi, WP va PHP versiyalari hamda sayt tili','View Basic %s Info'=>'Asosiy %s maʼlumotlarini koʻrish','Current %s & SDK versions, and if active or uninstalled'=>'Joriy %s & SDK versiyalari, shuningdek ular faol yoki o\'chirilgani','Newsletter'=>'Axborotnoma','Updates, announcements, marketing, no spam'=>'Yangilanishlar, e\'lonlar, marketing, spam yo\'q','View Diagnostic Info'=>'Tashxis ma\'lumotlarini ko\'rish','WordPress & PHP versions, site language & title'=>'WordPress va PHP versiyalari, sayt tili va sarlavhasi','View Plugins & Themes List'=>'Plaginlar va mavzular ro\'yxatini ko\'rish','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Nomlar, sluglar, versiyalar va faol yoki faol emasligi','optional'=>'ixtiyoriy','Never miss an important update'=>'Muhim yangilanishni hech qachon o\'tkazib yubormang','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Muhim yangilanishni o‘tkazib yubormasligingiz va %s ni saytingizga moslashuvchanroq hamda siz xohlagan vazifalarni bajarishda samaraliroq qilishimizga yordam berish uchun ushbu ixtiyoriy funksiyani joriy qildik.','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'%1$s v%2$s ga yangilaganingiz uchun tashakkur!','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Prefiks 1 dan 8 gacha kichik harflar yoki raqamlardan iborat bo\'lishi, harf bilan boshlanishi va plagin nomiga teng bo\'lmasligi kerak.','You are not allowed to edit this item.'=>'Ushbu elementni tahrirlashga ruxsatingiz yoʻq.','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Buni qilishga ruxsat etilmagan.','Safe mode was turned off because it no longer matches your login. Reload the page.'=>'Xavfsiz rejim o\'chirildi, chunki u endi sizning kirishingizga mos kelmaydi. Sahifani qayta yuklang.','Only an administrator can use safe mode.'=>'Faqat administrator xavfsiz rejimdan foydalana oladi.','Safe mode needs a normal browser login.'=>'Xavfsiz rejim odatiy brauzer orqali kirishni talab qiladi.','Safe mode could not be set up.'=>'Xavfsiz rejimni oʻrnatib boʻlmadi.','Safe mode needs write access to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Xavfsiz rejim wp-content/mu-plugins papkasiga yozish huquqiga ega bo\'lishi kerak.','Safe mode could not write to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Xavfsiz rejim wp-content/mu-plugins papkasiga yoza olmadi.','Sandwich Studio'=>'Sandwich Studio','That page does not exist, or it has been deleted.'=>'Bu sahifa mavjud emas yoki o‘chirib yuborilgan.','Sorry, you are not allowed to edit this item in Sandwich Studio.'=>'Kechirasiz, sizga Sandwich Studio’da bu elementni tahrirlashga ruxsat etilmagan.','Sandwich Studio is not built. Reinstall the plugin.'=>'Sandwich Studio o\'rnatilmagan. Plaginni qaytadan o\'rnating.','Add title'=>'Sarlavha qo\'shish','Type / to choose a block'=>'Blokni tanlash uchun / kiriting','Loading Sandwich Studio…'=>'Sandwich Studio yuklanmoqda…','Sandwich Studio needs JavaScript. Use the normal editor instead.'=>'Sandwich Studio uchun JavaScript kerak. Buning o\'rniga oddiy tahrirlagichni ishlating.','Edit “%s” with Sandwich Studio'=>'“%s” nomini Sandwich Studio yordamida tahrirlash','Edit with Sandwich Studio'=>'Sandwich Studio bilan tahrirlash','Blank canvas'=>'Bo\'sh sahifa','A migration step is running right now. Try again in a minute.'=>'Hozirda migratsiya jarayoni bajarilmoqda. Bir daqiqadan so\'ng yana urinib ko\'ring.','Thank you for subscribing!'=>'Obuna bo\'lganingiz uchun rahmat!','Something went wrong. Please contact the administrator.'=>'Nimadir xato ketdi. Iltimos, administrator bilan bog\'laning.','Years'=>'Yillar','Months'=>'Oylar','Weeks'=>'Haftalar','Days'=>'Kunlar','Hours'=>'Soatlar','Minutes'=>'Daqiqalar','Seconds'=>'Soniya','Go to slide %d'=>'%d-slaydga o\'tish','You\'re already subscribed to our newsletter'=>'Siz allaqachon bizning axborotnomamizga obuna bo‘lgansiz','Email address is already subscribed.'=>'Elektron pochta manzili allaqachon obuna boʻlgan.','MailPoet plugin not found. Please contact the admin.'=>'MailPoet plagini topilmadi. Iltimos, administrator bilan bog\'laning.','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Zinn Digital® Ltd kompaniyasi bosh direktori Neil Lock tomonidan yaratilgan','Version %s'=>'Versiya %s','Page Builder Sandwich website'=>'Page Builder Sandwich veb-sayti','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Zinn Digital® veb-sayti','Settings saved.'=>'Sozlamalar saqlandi.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Pro rejalar va narxlarni ko\'rish','Front-end output'=>'Old tomon chiqishi','Class name prefix'=>'Sinf nomi prefiksi','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Plagin sahifalaringizda chop etadigan har bir klass nomi ushbu prefiks bilan boshlanadi, shuning uchun sahifalar qaysi plagin tomonidan yaratilganini oshkor qilmaydi. Harf bilan boshlanadigan 1 dan 8 gacha kichik harflar yoki raqamlar.','Save'=>'Saqlash','Beta updates'=>'Beta yangilanishlar','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Ushbu sayt yangilanish sifatida beta-versiyalarni qabul qiladi.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Bu saytga faqat barqaror versiyalar qabul qilinadi.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Buni Hisob sahifasida o\'zgartiring','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Beta versiyalar o\'z hisobiga ulangan litsenziyaga ega Pro o\'rnatishlariga taqdim etiladi. Ulangandan so\'ng, Hisob sahifasidan qo\'shilishingiz mumkin.','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'Ushbu postni o‘zgartirish so‘rovi yakunlanmasdan to‘xtatildi, shuning uchun post tashlab yuborildi. Uni o‘zgartirish uchun oching yoki bu yerdan qaytadan o‘zgartiring.','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'Tiklash uchun ushbu postning zaxira nusxasi mavjud emas.','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'Konvertatsiya qilingan tarkibni saqlab bo‘lmadi.','Unknown error.'=>'Noma\'lum xatolik.','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'Hali hech qanday eski kontent tekshirilmadi.','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Eski kontent tiklanmoqda: %1$d / %2$d ta xabar.','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Eski kontentni o\'tkazish: %1$d / %2$d ta post.','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'Bekor qilish yakunlandi: %1$d ta tiklandi, %2$d ta bajarilmadi.','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'O‘tkazish yakunlandi: %1$d tasi o‘tkazildi, %2$d tasi o‘zgarishsiz qoldi, %3$d tasi bajarilmadi.','Legacy content'=>'Eski kontent','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'Oldingi Page Builder Sandwich versiyalari yordamida yaratilgan sahifalar fonda bloklarga aylantiriladi. Har bir post avval zaxiralanadi, shuning uchun har bir aylantirishni bekor qilish mumkin.','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'%d ta post hali ham eski tarkibni saqlab turibdi.' . "\0" . '%d ta post hali ham eski tarkibni saqlamoqda.','%d post has a backup.'=>'%d ta xabar zaxira nusxasiga ega.' . "\0" . '%d ta postning zaxira nusxasi mavjud.','%d post could not be handled'=>'%d ta xabarni qayta ishlab bo‘lmadi' . "\0" . '%d ta xabarni qayta ishlab bo‘lmadi','Post %d'=>'%d-xabar','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Konvertatsiya boshlandi. U fonda davom etmoqda; bu sahifani tark etishingiz mumkin.','Convert legacy content'=>'Eski tarkibni oʻtkazish','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'O‘tkazilgan har bir xabarni eski kontentiga tiklaysizmi? Ushbu xabarlar o‘tkazilganidan keyin kiritilgan o‘zgarishlar yo‘qoladi.','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Bekor qilish boshlandi. U fonda davom etmoqda; bu sahifadan chiqib ketishingiz mumkin.','Undo all conversions'=>'Barcha o\'zgarishlarni bekor qilish','Shortcode tag'=>'Qisqa kod tegi','Use letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Faqat harflar, raqamlar, defis va pastki chiziqlardan foydalaning.','Attribute name'=>'Atribut nomi','Add attribute'=>'Atribut qo\'shish','Content'=>'Kontent','Shortcode'=>'Qisqa kod','Choose a shortcode tag in the block settings.'=>'Blok sozlamalarida shortkod tegini tanlang.','The "%s" control from the old editor is not available in the block editor. Enter the value as text.'=>'Eski muharrirdagi "%s" boshqaruv elementi blokli muharrirda mavjud emas. Qiymatni matn sifatida kiriting.','Choose image'=>'Rasm tanlash','Choose file'=>'Faylni tanlash','— Default —'=>'— Standart —','Advanced styling'=>'Kengaytirilgan uslublar','Inline CSS'=>'Ichki CSS','CSS declarations, f